OL,3,GNEWSAFormer councillor jailed for
OL,4,Aterror offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former councillor who discussed
OL,7,F"killing migrants when they arrive on
OL,8,Ftheir boats" and shared a manifesto by
OL,9,FNorwegian mass killer Anders Breivik
OL,10,Fhas been jailed.
OL,12,FIvan Jennings, 46, from Stafford, had
OL,13,Fpreviously admitted encouraging
OL,14,Fterrorism and disseminating a terrorism
OL,15,Fpublication.
OL,17,FLeicester Crown Court heard Jennings
OL,18,Fwas an active participant in several
OL,19,Fextreme right-wing Telegram groups and
OL,20,Fidentified a Pakistan Independence Day
OL,21,Fevent as a potential target.
